{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "原見海潮音月刊十八卷十一期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦曰我愛塵貪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無明緣行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "行緣識也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "識緣名色"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "名色緣六入也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六入緣觸"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "觸緣受也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "受緣愛也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即三論宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦即我見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即唯識宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦可第四卷前半為開發大悲，其下皆是方便究竟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此非得夙命智可了，若阿羅漢能知八萬大劫死此生\n彼之事，然八萬大劫初生何所始，八萬大劫後，又死何所終，仍不能了"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孔耶等諸人天\n教所行者不能出此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此無畏施，若救放生命，弭息兵災，除暴安良，成仁取義等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此為財施，若保幼、養老、恤貧、濟苦等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "改良風俗，整齊文化"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於常常時，於恆恆時，誠敬圓滿成就聖尊，誠敬真\n實深妙正法，誠敬律儀和悅淨眾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "國家教育亦政治攝，士農工賈皆政治業"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即本質"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "非遷\n流無常"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "非虛偽無實"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不可對付制伏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不可破除壞滅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眾生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宇宙萬有"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "娑婆譯曰堪能忍苦。娑婆世界為釋迦牟尼佛應化之世界，故稱釋迦牟尼佛化土。吾人所居之\n地球，即此中一極小部分"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "清淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "安樂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世間一切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此為西學\n之特點，其弊在於諸學分立而無最大之系統以為歸依，是以各樹一幟互不相下。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如黃巾白蓮等教及最近之義和團等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "東亞諸國如日本等之文化均由中國而輸入故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此歐西哲學家所自言者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上均就文化言非就統治權言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三界見惑，欲界思惑，色界思惑，無色界思惑，及無明為五住煩惱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "常樂我淨四德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五乘者，謂人乘、天乘、聲聞乘\n、緣覺乘、菩薩如來乘。三乘者，則於五乘之中簡除人天二乘。大乘起信論別說言之極詳，可以參\n考"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世間出世間一切生滅不生滅法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上就空間觀察下就時間觀察"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即閻羅王"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此如忽然動念即習慣之業力也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世俗謂靈魂轉生投胎也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同是惑迷故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同是業染故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即愛取"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即有"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即無明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如身體仍在是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此五者根力均各具"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如戒取之類"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "威儀具足"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如紅十字會醫院等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "阿羅漢果"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如善於語言善於文字等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "非自利"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "方"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "便"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "均龍樹菩薩造"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "龍樹弟子提婆造"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "破法相顯平等無相真如法性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大智度論有一切智者之語故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "黃檗有二，此係明代之黃檗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "黃槃弟子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如十惡等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此身三業，若在家者受十戒可改淫為邪\n淫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此口四業，較人乘妄語為詳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此意三業，\n人乘之戒飲酒亦同此意、以能令人神智昏迷故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "分十重四十八輕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "未詳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見下果門派"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如大悲咒等各有法印"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如唵字㘕字等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "但取久已成佛之本門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "參閱道\n學論衡中之哲學正觀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "參閱道學論衡中之教育\n新見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "參閱道學\n論衡中之破神執論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "參\n閱道學論衡中之訂天演宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如物質之原質、生理之細胞"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "時間觀察"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "空間觀察"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眾法積聚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "剎那生滅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "人對非人等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生滅假相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不生滅法性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如上帝等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此種謬想以中國人為最，其餘各國亦有之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中國最甚各國亦有"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "近世催眠術亦可證明此理"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如道家所謂虛無道體"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "外國人亦有，但不如中國人之甚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "人類粗五欲即財色名食睡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如婆羅門族、\n\n剎帝利族、毗舍族為征服者，首陀族為被征服者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "參看序論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "序論第三章第五節"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "最短的時間謂之\n剎那"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "色法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "化學上的原子電子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世界也是業力為緣所成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無上菩提"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "輪迴"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "菩薩不是偶像的代名詞，乃有覺悟的眾生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "回事向理、回理向事到事理不二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "回自向他、回他向自，自他不二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "與思想上假思理想不同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平常思想是相對的分別的，就是非彼此互相對待而言的"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "但言說不過做進行上的指導方向，如以手指月"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圓寂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊九卷第九及十期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "相用"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "性體"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "堅濕煖動"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "空"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "包括日本"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊十卷十期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "喻如明心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "菩薩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明心見性之真性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六度外加方便、願、力、智"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禪悅為食"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海潮音月刊十三卷第十期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即今尼泊爾附\n近"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三界內之六道謂之六凡，三界外之三乘及佛謂之四聖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宇宙萬有"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼彼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "對人現人身、對天現天身、對畜生現畜生身、一切總是隨類應化\n普度群機"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊十七卷第一期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊一卷六期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "精神的種現"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "物質的種現"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無明"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦曰元論、玄論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊\n二卷四期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "菩薩乘佛乘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見支那內學院各書"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今曰空慧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今曰真如"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "識言詮心心所"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂簡我法及持相性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊五卷五期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又名無分別智"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊七卷六期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊十五卷四期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "記者謹案：中國庸儒，每耳食佛家有因果之論，輒謂佛教之談因果，其於世道人心亦\n不無小補；實屬乖謬已極，可知彼輩於佛經佛論必未曾寓目，於因果之理，必完全不能彷\n彿其粗義也。夫釋氏所云因果之理，乃如實而言，豈彼橫記妄說為如是如是哉！釋氏之意\n，亦非借此論以駭懼世人，使勿殺人放火也；亦非待釋氏道出因果之論，而後世間方有因\n果報應也；惟因事相本來實現為如此如此，故釋氏說為如此如此。蓋以於事實上雖因果昭\n\n昭不爽，然異生身為異熟之報所礙而不能見其底蘊；心為種種戲論所障而不能明其正情；\n故釋氏集合異生分上所有之種種事情，於其共同點上指出其因果之公理，次復告之以人生\n輪迴之事情，使之由此理上比知必有六道輪迴之事實。世人不曉，而謂因果之教，唯是釋\n氏所施設，唯是佛教徒所迷信，豈人生真有所謂因果輪迴來生來世哉！縱聞有二三現見之\n果報等事，亦不過適逢其會耳！總之，輪迴非現前可見證，來生亦渺不可親覺，吾不信焉\n，吾不信焉。吁嗟乎！中國人之未出國門者，不見有美國，不信有美國，而美國豈即因其\n不信而即消沒乎？彼輩不信有業報，而業報豈即因其不信而遂無乎？知與不知，信與不信\n，而因果之理，業報之事，本來如是如是；吾甚為昧者危焉！"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海\n刊四卷十期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或四，包括施戒忍進"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "例聲聞律各跋渠"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "嗡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "啞"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "拉圖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "嗡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "例禪之禪宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊十六卷\n四期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦曰諸法離名種分別之自相，亦曰勝義勝義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊四卷十二期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即諸法均要有此二緣方得起故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "視覺等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "賢首宗多說緣成，\n以此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "神我無、蘊入界有"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "近於大乘、但不究竟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "通於人天乘、主我法皆有"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "日本密宗空海大師曾判此宗為極無自性性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "畢竟空"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眾\n緣生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眾緣生即畢竟空、畢竟空即眾緣生，空假不二即中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即轉識成智"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "變起"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "淨曰智"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "染曰識"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或托本質或惟自識"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡是存在的，皆是被知的"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又可曰無明緣\n起"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "指六識上之迷事迷理者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即所緣緣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即佛果上之識、亦通眾生之前六第八現\n量心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又名無相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "總持諸行為一行的方便"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大解脫"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切智智"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛果法身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊十二卷五期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "萬法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "主因助緣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊二十卷第六期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因緣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "過去法藏、現在法藏、未來法藏、無為法藏、不可說藏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大乘宗派中也有作這樣主張的"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "淨分依他"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "現行意言分別之法，不一定都是遍計執性，但遍計\n執性，必定都是現行意言分別所起的"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海\n刊二十二卷十期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並無其他深意"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因為五乘三乘共法，只攝大乘一分，故不\n另"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊十八卷十二期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或云法\n\n界"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊二十\n卷第六期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以錫蘭為代表"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以中國的漢文為代表"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以中國的西藏文為代表"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即八指頭陀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即於中、百、十二門三論外添\n一大智度論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊十八卷九期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊十四卷三期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊十四卷十一期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一華嚴經，二解深密經，三如來出現功德經，四大\n乘阿毗達磨經，五楞伽阿跋多羅寶經，六大乘密嚴經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一瑜伽師地論——本論，二百法\n論，三五蘊論，四顯揚聖教論，五攝大乘論，六阿毗達磨雜集論，七辨中邊論，八二十唯識論，九\n\n成唯識論，十大乘莊嚴經論，十一分別瑜伽論——這十部是支論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一無量壽經，二觀無量壽佛經，三佛說阿彌陀經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即菩\n提流支所譯之往生淨土論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊十五卷九期"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不過正式可稱為教下的，是天台、\n賢首、慈恩的三家"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此圖製於民國十二年，曾演講數次：民二十年最後一次在柏林寺講時，由法舫紀錄\n\n，現有大乘宗地圖釋單行本流行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦\n名大乘特法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見海刊二十一卷第十期"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0001001", "type": "orig", "text": "本論略本，民國十五年八月，在北平佛學研究會講，羅庸及黃中疆、駱德先筆記，當由佛學研究會印行流通。十九年，增入學史及結論部分，改名佛學ABC，交世界書局發行。三十一年，重加治定，復佛學概論之名，是為廣本，漢藏教理院刊行，即今本所依。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0010002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0010002", "type": "orig", "text": "學史編十之四五，係節取佛教宗派源流會入本論者，不復詳註，讀者可參閱之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0062003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0062003", "type": "orig", "text": "結論，係依據大圓、罘月、莘野合記之「什麼是佛學」，略為刪節而成。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0069004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0069004", "type": "orig", "text": "下有第六節「初步佛學書的介紹」，從略。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0109001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0109001", "type": "orig", "text": "本論初版，廣東佛學社印行。二十二年，佛學書局再版，重加治正。三十四年，三加治正，由漢藏教理院刊行。今依漢院本，偶有一二簡潤處，不復備出。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0175002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0175002", "type": "orig", "text": "漢院本作「故知證果同出家者所能成辦」疑誤，今取意改。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0497001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0497001", "type": "orig", "text": "原題「對世界佛學苑圖書館員訓話」，今改題。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0497002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0497002", "type": "orig", "text": "此節頗有刪略，所論考校與編譯，可參看佛教的教史教法和今後的建設。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0140a1201", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0140a1201", "type": "add", "text": "斂【CB】，歛【太虛】"}
